      flag: clue-scar
      loyalty: 0
      mercy: 0
      suspicion: 0
      shards: 0
  - id: sel-22
    after: 22
    from: Sel
    text: Curfew means the clinic shuts at midnight. I'll be fine. 50% fine.
    when:
    - sel-sick
    choices: []
  - id: landlord-22
    after: 22
    from: Landlord Mott
    text: Curfew. Lattice says lights out at midnight. Your lamp was on till 03:00.
      I didn't see it. This time.
    when:
    - '!sel-sick'
    choices: []
  - id: sel-23
    after: 23
    from: Sel
    text: The Earth song stopped. I liked it. Is it bad that I liked it?
    when: []
    choices: []
  - id: graav-23
    after: 23
    from: Supervisor Graav
    text: Tomorrow I watch your window from the gallery. All night. Give me a reason,
      Ilo. I'm hoping you won't.
    when:
    - suspected
    choices: []
  - id: w3-log
    after: 24
    from: Unknown
    text: "Duun from Maintenance kept a copy of the lift log. Every trip down, every
      name. He'll hand it to someone he trusts. Is that you? \u2014 W3"
    when:
