      loyalty: 0
      mercy: 0
      suspicion: 2
      shards: 0
    - text: Too risky.
      reply: "Then we wait. Waiting is also a choice. \u2014 W3"
      flag: 
      loyalty: 0
      mercy: 0
      suspicion: 0
      shards: 0
  - id: sel-24
    after: 24
    from: Sel
    text: Graav came to Block 22 today and asked the landlord about us. He was 0%
      friendly. Are we in trouble?
    when: []
    choices: []
  - id: graav-25
    after: 25
    from: Supervisor Graav
    text: Copied faces. Copied names. Copied papers. The only thing they can't copy
      is how a citizen behaves. Watch behaviour.
    when: []
    choices: []
  - id: sel-25
    after: 25
    from: Sel
    text: No medicine again. It's okay. I know it's expensive. I know you're trying.
