    choices: []
  - id: graav-26
    after: 26
    from: Supervisor Graav
    text: Three inspectors. Three arrests. At the Grand Audit, that number will be
      read aloud.
    when:
    - flag:inspector3:security
    choices: []
  - id: sel-26
    after: 26
    from: Sel
    text: Next cycle I'm going to apply for the Tower junior programme. I want to
      be a window person. Like you!
    when: []
    choices: []
  - id: graav-27
    after: 27
    from: Supervisor Graav
    text: The Grand Auditor arrives tomorrow and will test the windows in person.
      Do your job. Just your job. Nothing extra.
    when: []
    choices: []
  - id: w3-27
    after: 27
    from: Unknown
    text: "The Grand Audit is our one chance. Every lift in the Tower opens for the
      inspection. If the city sees the basement, it can't pretend anymore. Get ready.
      \u2014 W3"
    when:
    - flag:w3-silent
    choices: []
  - id: graav-28-auditor
    after: 28
    from: Supervisor Graav
    text: You arrested the Grand Auditor. He was released. You will not be, if it
      happens again.
    when:
    - flag:auditor1:security
    choices: []
  - id: sel-28
    after: 28
    from: Sel
    text: I have a clinic appointment tomorrow night. At YOUR window! Is that allowed?
      I'm bringing you dinner. Don't tell Graav.
    when: []
    choices: []
  - id: finale-w3
    after: 29
    from: Unknown
    text: "Tomorrow at 02:00, open the service lift for us. With proof, the city
      sees the basement. Without it\u2026 we just walk into a trap. Your choice,
      Ilo. \u2014 W3"
    when:
    - flag:w3-silent
    choices:
    - text: '"I''ll open it."'
      reply: "Then tomorrow, everything changes. \u2014 W3"
      flag: finale-open
      loyalty: 0
      mercy: 1
      suspicion: 0
      shards: 0
    - text: '"No. I''m done."'
      reply: "Then thank you for everyone you already let through. \u2014 W3"
      flag: 
      loyalty: 1
      mercy: 0
      suspicion: 0
      shards: 0
  - id: finale-graav
    after: 29
    from: Supervisor Graav
    text: Do tomorrow right and floor 9 is yours. An office. A real salary. Sel's
      medicine, every night, for life. Think about it.
    when:
    - loyal
    choices:
    - text: '"Yes, Supervisor."'
      reply: Good. Don't make me regret it.
      flag: finale-loyal
      loyalty: 2
      mercy: 0
      suspicion: 0
      shards: 0
    - text: Say nothing.
      reply: (He waits. You don't answer.)
      flag: 
      loyalty: 0
      mercy: 0
      suspicion: 0
      shards: 0
  - id: sel-29
    after: 29
    from: Sel
    text: Tomorrow's the big night! Whatever happens at the Tower, I'm 100% proud
      of you. Even if you blink. I know you blink. It's okay.
    when:
    - '!flag:sel1:security'
    choices: []
  - id: sel-29-arrested
    after: 29
    from: Lattice Clinic
    text: Your sibling Sel was released from Tower security at 03:00 and is resting
      at home. Sel has not said a word since. Sel left your dinner on the table.
    when:
    - flag:sel1:security
    choices: []
  - id: lattice-29
    after: 29
    from: Civic Lattice
    text: GRAND AUDIT NOTICE. All Night Window staff report at 20:00. Every decision
      tonight will be reviewed. At 02:00 the Tower locks down. Glory to the Lattice.
    when: []
    choices: []
  upgrades:
  - id: uv-lamp
    name: UV lamp
    text: 'Shows genuine holograms: real ones glow with rings, printed fakes stay
      flat.'
    price: 60
    unlockShift: 6
    tool: uv
  - id: gill-scope
    name: Gill-scope
    text: 'Shows the neck up close: real gills pulse, a suit''s gills sit still.'
    price: 80
    unlockShift: 11
    tool: gillscope
  - id: fourth-question
    name: 4th question licence
    text: One more question for every visitor.
    price: 120
    unlockShift: 16
    tool: q4
  tutorial:
    shift: 1
    visitors:
    - kind: OrdinaryCitizen
      tells: []
      violation: 
    - kind: ClumsyHuman
      tells:
      - RoundPupils
      - SaysFine
      violation: 
    - kind: RuleBreakerCitizen
      tells: []
      violation: Expired
    steps:
    - visitor: 1
      target: window
      wait: tap
      text: 'Welcome to Night Window 3! Every visitor says they''re a citizen of
        Vel''Tara. Some are HUMANS hiding in stolen bio-suits. Your job: spot them.'
    - visitor: 1
      target: id
      wait: tap
      text: 'This is their Civic Lattice ID. First check: does the PHOTO match the
        face at the window? Same clan, same face, slit pupils.'
    - visitor: 1
      target: slip
      wait: tap
      text: This is their appointment slip. The NAME must match the ID exactly, and
        the FLOOR must be in the ID's floor access.
    - visitor: 1
      target: topbar
      wait: tap
      text: 'Up here: tonight''s date, the clock and your score. An ID that EXPIRES
        before tonight''s date is no good.'
    - visitor: 1
      target: questions
      wait: ask
      text: "You can ask each visitor 3 questions. Pick one now. Try \u201CHow are
        you feeling tonight?\u201D"
    - visitor: 1
      target: log
      wait: tap
      text: "Every answer goes in this log. Citizens state a mood, like \u201CI am
        60% content.\u201D"
    - visitor: 1
      target: rulebook
      wait: tap
      text: Not sure what's normal? The RULEBOOK lists how citizens look and behave,
        and every desk rule.
    - visitor: 1
      target: letin
      wait: letin
      text: 'Matching papers, a matching face, a citizen''s answer. This is a citizen:
        press LET IN.'
    - visitor: 2
      target: window
      wait: tap
      text: 'Look closely at this visitor''s eyes: ROUND pupils! Every citizen has
        vertical slit pupils.'
    - visitor: 2
      target: question:greeting
      wait: ask:greeting
      text: Ask how they're feeling, and read the answer.
    - visitor: 2
      target: log
      wait: tap
      text: "\u201CFine\u201D instead of a mood: another human slip. Humans also
        blink, sweat, and show five fingers."
    - visitor: 2
      target: security
      wait: security
      text: This is a human in a suit. HOLD Call Security until the bar fills.
    - visitor: 3
      target: id
      wait: tap
      text: This one looks like a real citizen. But compare the ID's EXPIRES date
        with tonight's date at the top.
    - visitor: 3
      target: away
      wait: away
      text: The ID has expired. A real citizen who breaks a rule is TURNED AWAY,
        never arrested.
    - visitor: 4
      target: decisions
      wait: tap
      text: 'That''s the job. Humans: CALL SECURITY. Rule-breakers: TURN AWAY. Everyone
        else: LET IN. The rest of tonight is up to you!'
